---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro'; import '../../styles.css';
---
<Base title="Platform — VELTRIX" description="Explore the VELTRIX platform and its components.">
  <section class="container page-hero"><div class="eyebrow">Platform overview</div><h1>One platform.<br/>A more connected setup.</h1><p class="lead">VELTRIX is built around a simple idea: infrastructure management should be clear, modular and within reach.</p></section>
  <section class="container section" style="padding-top:0"><div class="feature-grid">
    <article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">▦</div><h3>VELTRIX Dock</h3><p>A central workspace for organising and managing connected devices, websites and services.</p><a href="/download/" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:22px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700">Explore Dock ↗</a></article>
    <article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">⌁</div><h3>VELTRIX Agent</h3><p>A lightweight device-side component that connects your environment to the control plane.</p><a href="/download/" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:22px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700">Get Agent ↗</a></article>
    <article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">◎</div><h3>VELTRIX Control</h3><p>The control-plane foundation coordinating device communication and platform operations.</p><a href="/about/" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:22px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700">Learn more ↗</a></article>
  </div></section>
  <section class="band"><div class="container band-inner"><div><div class="eyebrow" style="color:#a9baff">Designed as a system</div><h2 style="margin-top:20px">Clear parts.<br/>One consistent experience.</h2><p>Each component has a focused role, while the platform brings the whole picture together.</p></div><a class="button button-white" href="/download/">Get started ↗</a></div></section>
</Base>
